{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T05:00:53Z","created_by_operation":"op_d389d2a3f7cd45e0ba54966088f6adca","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_513146c11a32086475aa522951bf64e5edef50dfbb97a574a308fccdb8954b6d","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=skills-patterns","setting":"mbruhler/claude-orchestration@47fd2623a46d snapshot 9303df1c465c0ce0","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_78201c207948a8370875a82094d63d8045110909d28aa3f32d4cf188350de012","slc_9d7ed556c830236f85b4f17154bcb72adefafab177585605bf4d72d74e4764e9","slc_eb4aefe88d18ca9125d62b384f6da123d8ff5bd1e55014207ad1b1da6aa5a531","slc_f82d6991cff497367a2f889624feb0e7d1464cb31e47a84b3b92f37526673dcf"],"source_ids":["src_d5c3ff1effa350b394609e20a1f66d54"],"text":"Documentation describes an agent-promotion flow: after a workflow completes, temporary agents are analyzed for reusability (generic versus workflow-specific), and selected ones are moved from a temp-agents directory into a permanent agents directory and registered, while unselected ones are deleted.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T05:00:53Z","updated_by_operation":"op_d389d2a3f7cd45e0ba54966088f6adca"}
